### GET request to example server
GET http://localhost:8080/RestWebApp/api/calcul/somme?a=2&b=3
###
### Division par 0 (attendu 400)
GET http://localhost:8080/RestWebApp/api/calcul/division?a=7&b=0

### Produit PathParam (attendu 42)
GET http://localhost:8080/RestWebApp/api/calcul/produit/6/7

### D.3 : b absent
GET http://localhost:8080/RestWebApp/api/calcul/somme?a=2

### D.3 : a non entier
GET http://localhost:8080/RestWebApp/api/calcul/somme?a=abc&b=3